# 03 — Control matrix

The real cross-product: every one of the 28 AICPA Trust Services criteria
this binder tracks, one row each, **regardless of whether this project has
supplied evidence for it yet**. A criterion with no fact renders as `NOT
STARTED` — visible by its presence in this table, not invisible by its
absence from it.

